body:
If money was taken by mistake or a paid feature did not work, write to Help & support → "Payment" with:
- the phone number you paid from;
- the date and amount;
- the transaction ID from the operator SMS.

We answer within 1 working day. If the payment really failed on our side, we return the money to the same mobile money account.

Zumi cannot return money you paid directly to an agent or owner — Zumi is not part of deals between users. In that case contact the person, and if you think it is fraud, report the listing and go to the police.
